{"id":"privacidad","lemma":"privacidad","pos":"noun","rank":2928,"glosses":["privacy"],"ipa":"/pɾibaθiˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"privacidades"},"order":2933,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a0/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-privacidad.wav","examples":[{"text":"No te metas en su privacidad.","en":"Don't intrude on her privacy.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"goal, target","l":"meta"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"No debes invadir la privacidad de otros.","en":"You must not invade the privacy of others.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to invade"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"someone else","l":"otro"}]},{"text":"La gente por lo general se vuelve famosa a costa de su privacidad.","en":"People usually become famous at the cost of their privacy.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"people"},null,null,null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to return","l":"volver"},{"g":"well-known, famous","l":"famoso"},null,null,null,{"g":"his / her / your"},null],"phrases":[[2,5,"generally"],[8,11,"at the expense of"]]}]}